---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++20
ColumnLimit: 100        # 允许更长的单行代码，适合长函数名
IndentWidth: 4          # 4空格缩进，层级更清晰
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
PointerAlignment: Left  # 指针靠左 (例如 int* a)
ReflowComments: true
SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty # 禁止将短函数挤在一行
...